Complete local PHP example; the app itself does not execute it:
```php
<?php
declare(strict_types=1);
$fiber = new Fiber(function (): string {
    $reply = Fiber::suspend("paused");
    return "done:" . $reply;
});
echo $fiber->start(), "\n";
$fiber->resume("ok");
echo $fiber->getReturn(), "\n";

```

